# 1. STRICT RULES & ARCHITECTURE

**1.1 CSS-First Architecture & Zero Inline CSS**
- All styling lives in `style.css`. **Forbidden:** `style="..."` attributes, inline `<style>` blocks, presentational HTML attributes, inline SVGs.
- Style exclusively via class/ID selectors. HTML stays semantic and style-agnostic — retheming must require editing CSS only.
- Decorative elements (traffic lights, connectors, shimmer bars) are empty spans/divs or pseudo-elements, `aria-hidden`.

**1.2 CSS Variables & Theme Tokens**
Adopt the source token set verbatim as the light theme, extended with the mandatory additions below. All values are CSS variables in `:root` — no hardcoded hexes in component rules.

```css
:root {
  /* color — light (source spec) */
  --color-bg: #dfe6ee;
  --color-surface: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
  --color-surface-strong: rgba(255,255,255,0.78);
  --color-border: rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  --color-text: #1d1d1f;
  --color-text-muted: rgba(29,29,31,0.6);
  --color-primary: #007aff;
  --color-on-primary: #ffffff;
  --color-accent: #ff9f0a;
  --color-scrim: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  /* mandatory additions */
  --color-success: #34c759;
  --color-error: #ff3b30;
  --color-border-success: rgba(52,199,89,0.55);
  --color-border-error: rgba(255,59,48,0.55);
  --surface-fallback: #f2f5f9;
  /* radius / shadow / blur / fonts / type scale / spacing: use source values */
  --radius-sm: 8px; --radius-md: 10px; --radius-lg: 14px; --radius-pill: 999px;
  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  --shadow-md: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
  --shadow-lg: 0 20px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.14);
  --shadow-inset-hi: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
  --blur-backdrop: 20px; --blur-backdrop-strong: 30px;
  --vibrancy: blur(var(--blur-backdrop)) saturate(1.8);
  --vibrancy-strong: blur(var(--blur-backdrop-strong)) saturate(1.8);
  --font-sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, 'SF Pro Text', 'Helvetica Neue', system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-display: 'Inter', -apple-system, 'SF Pro Display', system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-mono: 'Roboto Mono', 'SF Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
  /* motion + stacking (mandatory additions) */
  --transition-fast: 150ms; --transition-normal: 250ms;
  --ease-standard: cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1);
  --z-dropdown: 1000; --z-modal: 1100; --z-toast: 1200;
  /* wallpaper */
  --bg-image: linear-gradient(160deg, #a7c6f2 0%, #dfe6ee 45%, #f3d9c4 100%);
}
```

- **Signature material recipe** — every glass surface combines: translucent background token + `backdrop-filter: var(--vibrancy)` (with `-webkit-` prefix) + 1px `--color-border` hairline + `--shadow-inset-hi` inner highlight. `body` carries `background: var(--bg-image); background-attachment: fixed;` so materials sample the wallpaper.
- **Material tiers:** *menu* (nav, dropdown) = `--color-surface` + `--vibrancy` + `--shadow-sm`; *panel* (cards, FAQ, form) = `--color-surface` + `--vibrancy` + `--shadow-md`; *HUD* (badges, toggle, featured pricing, hero window) = `--color-surface-strong` + `--vibrancy-strong` + `--shadow-md`/`--shadow-lg`.
- **Fallbacks (mandatory):** `@supports not ((backdrop-filter: blur(1px)) or (-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(1px)))` and `@media (prefers-reduced-transparency: reduce)` both swap glass surfaces to solid `var(--surface-fallback)` and disable filters.
- **Contrast pairing:** every light background token pairs with dark text tokens, every dark background token with light text tokens — enforced in both themes. Never use `#ffffff` as a page background; the wallpaper `#dfe6ee` is the light base; use `#fefefe` if a near-white is ever needed.

**1.3 Mandatory Dark Mode Support**
